info.thermalharvest.harvester=Harvests, replants and tends crops growing on farmland.
info.thermalharvest.area=Harvest area
info.thermalharvest.augmentSlots=Augment slots
info.thermalharvest.scanSpeed=Scan speed
info.thermalharvest.columnsPerSecond=col/s

tab.thermalharvest.harvester.0=Harvests ripe crops from the farmland around it and replants them right away. Works in a square centered on the machine and covers three layers of plants: the machine's level, one block above and one below.
tab.thermalharvest.harvester.1=Fertilizer in the left slot speeds up growth. It is only spent on crops that are still growing. Different fertilizers can be mixed: the stored strength becomes their average.
tab.thermalharvest.harvester.2=Harvested items are kept in an internal buffer. While it is full, harvesting waits until items are taken out or pushed into an adjacent inventory.
tab.thermalharvest.harvester.3=Upgrading the machine increases the area (from 3x3 to 11x11) and the scan speed.
tab.thermalharvest.harvester.4=Sides: blue - fertilizer input, green - fertilizer only, orange - harvest output. With the Irrigation Module, blue also accepts water and purple accepts water only.
tab.thermalharvest.harvester.5=IC2 crop sticks are supported too: harvesting, weeding, nutrients and watering.

