info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterRange.0=Crop Harvester: Harvest Area
info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterRange.a.0=Extends the harvest area by 1 block in every horizontal direction.
info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterRange.a.1=Stacks when multiple augments are installed.
info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterRange.b.0=Increases energy usage by 25%.
info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterRange.b.1=A full scan of the area takes longer.

info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterIrrigation.0=Crop Harvester: Irrigation
info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterIrrigation.a.0=Adds a 10,000 mB water tank.
info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterIrrigation.a.1=While the tank holds water, all farmland in the harvest area stays hydrated, like next to a water source.
info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterIrrigation.a.2=Keeps IC2 crop sticks supplied with water.
info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterIrrigation.b.0=Water is only spent on irrigated blocks: farmland and crop sticks.
info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterIrrigation.c.0=Only one may be installed.

info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterRecycler.0=Crop Harvester: Fertilizer Economy
info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterRecycler.a.0=Provides a 20% chance not to consume stored fertilizer.
info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterRecycler.a.1=Stacks when multiple augments are installed (up to 80%).

info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterCatalyst.0=Crop Harvester: Fertilizer Potency
info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterCatalyst.a.0=Raises the growth speed from fertilizer by one step (e.g. x2 -> x3).
info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterCatalyst.b.0=Fertilizer is consumed faster.
info.thermalharvest.augment.harvesterCatalyst.c.0=Only one may be installed.

